      "title": "BTSDP: Prevent signed integer overflow Undefined Behavior",
      "message": "BTSDP: Prevent signed integer overflow Undefined Behavior\n\nRearrange some calculations to prevent signed overflow. Note that\ndissect_data_element returns the offset after the data element,\neven though most callers don't use it. However, to eliminate that,\nthe dissector would need to do some more type and length checking\nto handle unexpected data without overflow.\n\nOSS-Fuzz Issue 445765482\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
